!- Drei Saetze statt zwei. Der Oeffnungsfaktor ist bei DetailedOpening
!- KEIN Flaechenanteil: die durchstroemte Flaeche folgt aus
!- Width Factor x Height Factor x Fensterflaeche, beide Faktoren werden
!- zwischen den Saetzen linear interpoliert. Mit nur zwei Saetzen ergaebe
!- der Oeffnungsfaktor 0,048 eine Flaeche von 0,048 x 0,048 x 9 = 0.0207 m2
!- statt der beabsichtigten 0.432 m2.
!- Satz 2 bildet den angedockten LKW ab: umlaufende Dichtungsleckage,
!- flaechengleich abgebildet als waagerechter Spalt in Toroeffnungsmitte
!- (Width Factor 1, Height Factor 0.048, Start Height Factor 0.476).
!- Die Lage in Mittenhoehe haelt den Auftriebsterm neutral - ein Bodenspalt
!- wuerde einen gerichteten Auftriebsstrom erzeugen, den WSOA und DFR
!- konstruktionsbedingt nicht abbilden koennen. SETZUNG, siehe README.
AirflowNetwork:MultiZone:Component:DetailedOpening,
    AFN_Tor,                 !- Name
    0.001,                   !- Air Mass Flow Coefficient When Opening is Closed {kg/s-m}
    0.65,                    !- Air Mass Flow Exponent When Opening is Closed {dimensionless}
    NonPivoted,              !- Type of Rectangular Large Vertical Opening (LVO)
    0,                       !- Extra Crack Length or Height of Pivoting Axis {m}
    3,                       !- Number of Sets of Opening Factor Data
    0,                       !- Opening Factor 1 {dimensionless}
    0.001,                   !- Discharge Coefficient for Opening Factor 1 {dimensionless}
    0,                       !- Width Factor for Opening Factor 1 {dimensionless}
    0,                       !- Height Factor for Opening Factor 1 {dimensionless}
    0,                       !- Start Height Factor for Opening Factor 1 {dimensionless}
    0.048,                   !- Opening Factor 2 {dimensionless}
    0.62,                    !- Discharge Coefficient for Opening Factor 2 {dimensionless}
    1,                       !- Width Factor for Opening Factor 2 {dimensionless}
    0.048,                   !- Height Factor for Opening Factor 2 {dimensionless}
    0.476,                   !- Start Height Factor for Opening Factor 2 {dimensionless}
    1,                       !- Opening Factor 3 {dimensionless}
    0.62,                    !- Discharge Coefficient for Opening Factor 3 {dimensionless}
    1,                       !- Width Factor for Opening Factor 3 {dimensionless}
    1,                       !- Height Factor for Opening Factor 3 {dimensionless}
    0;                       !- Start Height Factor for Opening Factor 3 {dimensionless}


!- ============================================================================
!-   ENERGYMANAGEMENTSYSTEM  (OEFFNUNGSFAKTOR DER TORE)
!- ============================================================================

!- Der Aktor 'AirFlow Network Window/Door Opening' / 'Venting Opening
!- Factor' setzt den Oeffnungsfaktor je Zeitschritt auf den Schedulewert
!- (0 zu, 0.048 angedockt, 1 offen). Application Guide for EMS, Air Movement.
!- Kennung des Aktors ist der Name der Fensterflaeche, nicht des
!- AirflowNetwork-Objekts.
EnergyManagementSystem:Sensor,
    Sens_Tor1,               !- Name
    AN_1_Tor_Schedule,       !- Output:Variable or Output:Meter Index Key Name
    Schedule Value;          !- Output:Variable or Output:Meter Name

EnergyManagementSystem:Sensor,
    Sens_Tor2,               !- Name
    AN_2_Tor_Schedule,       !- Output:Variable or Output:Meter Index Key Name
    Schedule Value;          !- Output:Variable or Output:Meter Name

EnergyManagementSystem:Sensor,
    Sens_Tor3,               !- Name
    AN_3_Tor_Schedule,       !- Output:Variable or Output:Meter Index Key Name
    Schedule Value;          !- Output:Variable or Output:Meter Name

EnergyManagementSystem:Sensor,
    Sens_Tor4,               !- Name
    AB_1_Tor_Schedule,       !- Output:Variable or Output:Meter Index Key Name
    Schedule Value;          !- Output:Variable or Output:Meter Name

EnergyManagementSystem:Sensor,
    Sens_Tor5,               !- Name
    AB_2_Tor_Schedule,       !- Output:Variable or Output:Meter Index Key Name
    Schedule Value;          !- Output:Variable or Output:Meter Name

EnergyManagementSystem:Sensor,
    Sens_Tor6,               !- Name
    AB_3_Tor_Schedule,       !- Output:Variable or Output:Meter Index Key Name
    Schedule Value;          !- Output:Variable or Output:Meter Name

EnergyManagementSystem:Actuator,
    Act_Tor1,                !- Name
    gate 1,                  !- Actuated Component Unique Name
    AirFlow Network Window/Door Opening, !- Actuated Component Type
    Venting Opening Factor;  !- Actuated Component Control Type

EnergyManagementSystem:Actuator,
    Act_Tor2,                !- Name
    gate 2,                  !- Actuated Component Unique Name
    AirFlow Network Window/Door Opening, !- Actuated Component Type
    Venting Opening Factor;  !- Actuated Component Control Type

